Algorithm: Person DOB Knowledge Base in Prolog
Start
Define person facts with their name and date of birth.
Create a rule get_dob(Name, DOB) to retrieve the DOB of a given person.
Create a rule find_person(DOB, Name) to find a person using their DOB.
Enter a query with a person's name or date of birth.
Prolog searches the knowledge base for matching facts.
If a match is found, display the person's details.
If no match is found, return no result.
